{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-20", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] = Don't Do(S) That!", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/464e5ec297d22864f8bc413116270598463be9901ecd225a3d3f4a0fea118889.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 Don't Do(S) That! 문제</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/be5f79d08c289e20059702c1e0b5c569645cb372db5e55063c924ee317ccadc0.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>파일을 다운로드 받고 zip을 풀면 .pcap 파일 발견.</p>\n<p>이 .pcap 파일을  WireShark로 열어보면</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/4a64dc6a04f72d9510678087fb6ff13057b49d1ae2976fcc10d4925d92db74f4.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>많은 패킷이 있는 것을 확인.</p>\n<p>패킷을 전체적으로 보다보면</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/58670345f44b4d5b805a9c145c74d297b3d01468cd3ebe7345e5ae103cdda801.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>약 17190번대부터 계속 무언가를 시도하는 패킷이 보임</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/cb7b08a67a08be7c8424d57f3ecd207202bb901dbde359cbd2c14aac3337e2cb.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>그 패킷들을 자세히 봤더니 모든 공격 패킷은 <span>00:0c:29:cf:3c:76을 가지는 것을 확인</span></p>\n<p><span>00:0c:29:cf:3c:76 주소를 가지면서 192.168.0.11 를 공격하려고 시도한 이를 알아내야함</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/d979520ab7f762c2c80efc670ce13ceea807146829dc2b33a572c9612039f2d9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>192.168.0.22 인것을 발견</p>\n<p>192.168.0.22를 base64 인코딩하면 flag 도출</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/ca1230d4147cf7f20979430b285e8f47877ebbc803a5b2212a42162d9741b939.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>", "assets": ["464e5ec297d22864f8bc413116270598463be9901ecd225a3d3f4a0fea118889.png", "4a64dc6a04f72d9510678087fb6ff13057b49d1ae2976fcc10d4925d92db74f4.png", "58670345f44b4d5b805a9c145c74d297b3d01468cd3ebe7345e5ae103cdda801.png", "be5f79d08c289e20059702c1e0b5c569645cb372db5e55063c924ee317ccadc0.png", "ca1230d4147cf7f20979430b285e8f47877ebbc803a5b2212a42162d9741b939.png", "cb7b08a67a08be7c8424d57f3ecd207202bb901dbde359cbd2c14aac3337e2cb.png", "d979520ab7f762c2c80efc670ce13ceea807146829dc2b33a572c9612039f2d9.png"]}